  "id": "loosening-of-associations",
  "term": "loosening of associations",
  "definition": "Loosening of associations is a disturbance in how thoughts or meanings are connected, so associations between ideas become disordered. In the packet, it is described as a key feature of schizophrenic psychopathology and linked to thought disruption.",
